  "decision_rationale": "No enhancement clears the strict bar on honest evidence. The interior weight variants (60/40, 40/60, 70/30, 30/70) and the historical robustness transforms are INSUFFICIENT_INPUTS -- the frozen 10-D/10-F/10-H outputs hold only summary stats for four fixed signals plus the latest 2026Q2 cross-section, not the historical scored panel with forward returns needed to re-backtest them. The only backtestable endpoints are the two single legs, both on the RAW (non-sector-neutral) basis and each failing an SN gate on its own terms: fcf_to_assets is OOS-unstable (frac-positive 0.375 < 0.6 gate) and operating_accruals is over-concentrated (top-sector 0.6316 > 0.6 gate). Packaging filters reshape the current book but cannot demonstrate net-of-cost alpha improvement from a single cross-section. Baseline stays champion (skeptical default upheld).",
